01:10:16.545 --> 01:10:18.604
What a lovely suit.


01:10:23.185 --> 01:10:24.277
Move it.


01:10:24.453 --> 01:10:26.853
Hey. Out of the way. Out of the way.
Michael, go on.


01:10:27.022 --> 01:10:29.286
