01:10:37.332 --> 01:10:39.197
Nice suit.


01:10:46.041 --> 01:10:49.977
What was that back there?
This is your last chance to get it right.


01:10:50.145 --> 01:10:53.114
Unless you wanna see
Angela's Juilliard dreams go bye-bye.


01:10:53.281 --> 01:10:57.240
That what you wanna be? A little
dwarfish Asian girl's dream crusher, huh?


01:10:57.419 --> 01:10:58.443
