- Ange.


01:11:15.103 --> 01:11:17.037
You're my best friend.


01:11:17.205 --> 01:11:19.639
Look, I'd do anything for you.


01:11:30.118 --> 01:11:31.949
Okay.


01:11:34.189 --> 01:11:38.717
So we're gonna take it up a notch
with Jason Berkeley and the Funky Funk.


01:11:44.566 --> 01:11:45.590
Scratch that.


01:11:45.767 --> 01:11:48.702
Um, here are my boys, the Oral Majority.


01:11:57.412 --> 01:11:59.880
<i>I'm lost in a world that rattles my brain</i>


01:12:00.048 --> 01:12:03.950
<i>Cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:12:06.755 --> 01:12:08.120
Move it. Guy.


01:12:08.290 --> 01:12:12.488
This is just the boring appetizer.
The real showstopper's up next.


01:12:12.661 --> 01:12:14.128
Ah!
Oh!


01:12:14.296 --> 01:12:17.163
You okay, Mr. Morgan?
Here, let me get that for you.


01:12:18.600 --> 01:12:19.794
Well, it had better be.


01:12:19.968 --> 01:12:21.196
I have to pee.


01:12:21.369 --> 01:12:24.600
Oh, I will take you to the pee, Mr. Victor.


01:12:27.542 --> 01:12:29.373
Sorry.


01:12:29.811 --> 01:12:32.336
<i>So keep on knocking, knocking, knocking</i>


01:12:32.514 --> 01:12:37.451
<i>But, baby, you're better off walking
'Cause I ain't gonna let you in</i>


01:12:38.186 --> 01:12:40.347
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:40.522 --> 01:12:43.582
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:43.758 --> 01:12:46.124
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:46.294 --> 01:12:49.627
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:54.436 --> 01:12:55.767
My brothers, yeah!


01:12:55.937 --> 01:12:57.336
Okay.


01:12:57.672 --> 01:12:59.833
You guys having a good time?


01:13:00.408 --> 01:13:04.811
Let's keep it going
with Beverly Van Ravensway.


01:13:16.925 --> 01:13:19.155
<i>Plug in the mike</i>


01:13:19.327 --> 01:13:20.624
