01:13:24.566 --> 01:13:26.659
<i>The feeling ignites</i>


01:13:26.835 --> 01:13:27.893
<i>I'm in control</i>


01:13:28.069 --> 01:13:32.165
<i>The crowd's in the palm of my hand
All my fans stand</i>


01:13:32.340 --> 01:13:35.776
<i>What is the truth?
What's an illusion?</i>


01:13:35.944 --> 01:13:39.641
<i>You're searching for proof
But are you certain?</i>


01:13:39.814 --> 01:13:43.375
<i>Whatever you see is what you get</i>


01:13:43.552 --> 01:13:47.352
<i>If words paint a picture
Then I bet you I can get you, yeah</i>


01:13:47.522 --> 01:13:51.754
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:13:51.927 --> 01:13:55.158
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:13:55.330 --> 01:13:58.766
<i>Tonight is the night
Where I'll make you see</i>


01:13:58.934 --> 01:14:02.631
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:14:02.804 --> 01:14:07.207
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:14:07.375 --> 01:14:08.842
<i>I can be what you want...</i>


01:14:12.714 --> 01:14:13.738
Give me...


01:14:20.422 --> 01:14:24.518
I'm so sorry, my mike...
My mike isn't working.


01:14:24.926 --> 01:14:27.417
Uh, excuse me.


01:14:30.298 --> 01:14:32.425
<i>I don't know.
- Give me that. Give me that.</i>


01:14:37.639 --> 01:14:41.871
