01:15:40.802 --> 01:15:42.929
<i>I got nothing to lose</i>


01:15:43.438 --> 01:15:44.803
<i>I've been exposed</i>


01:15:44.973 --> 01:15:47.100
<i>I'm paying my dues</i>


01:15:47.275 --> 01:15:48.435
<i>Playing the role</i>


01:15:48.610 --> 01:15:50.976
<i>I'm breaking the rules</i>


01:15:51.146 --> 01:15:52.340
<i>Flow in the flow</i>


01:15:52.514 --> 01:15:56.473
<i>I got the whole world nodding, yes
Like some bobbleheads</i>


01:15:56.651 --> 01:15:58.016
<i>I'll break a sweat</i>


01:15:59.220 --> 01:16:00.244
<i>If you want it</i>


01:16:00.422 --> 01:16:02.549
<i>Confess all your sins</i>


01:16:02.724 --> 01:16:04.021
<i>You know you got 'em</i>


01:16:04.192 --> 01:16:06.456
<i>The room's in a spin</i>


01:16:06.628 --> 01:16:07.652
<i>The fever's pitched</i>


01:16:07.829 --> 01:16:09.797
- You gotta go. Come on, get out there.
Aah!


01:16:09.964 --> 01:16:11.761
<i>I'm legit, I'm no counterfeit</i>


01:16:11.933 --> 01:16:16.393
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:16:16.571 --> 01:16:19.335
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:16:19.507 --> 01:16:23.170
<i>Tonight is the night where I make you see</i>


01:16:23.345 --> 01:16:26.974
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:16:27.148 --> 01:16:31.551
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:16:31.720 --> 01:16:32.914
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:16:33.088 --> 01:16:35.886
Hey! Shut that camera down! Now!


01:16:36.057 --> 01:16:38.525
<i>Tonight is the night where I make you see</i>


01:16:38.693 --> 01:16:42.595
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:16:42.764 --> 01:16:44.857
<i>You want from me</i>


01:16:51.306 --> 01:16:53.103
That's what I'm talking about.


01:16:54.943 --> 01:16:57.434
Shut the power down. Shut it down.


01:17:00.582 --> 01:17:02.982
Not so fast, jerknuts.


01:17:06.287 --> 01:17:07.652
Hey. Clear.


01:17:10.759 --> 01:17:13.159
<i>Sing something else.
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:13.328 --> 01:17:14.625
Like what?


01:17:14.896 --> 01:17:16.761
The demo you snuck my dad. I heard it.


01:17:16.931 --> 01:17:18.728
Yeah, do it!
Do it!


01:17:18.900 --> 01:17:24.270
<i>We want more!
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:27.041 --> 01:17:29.009
Okay, follow my lead, guys.


01:17:36.718 --> 01:17:40.711
<i>There's a little secret
I would like to tell you</i>


01:17:43.825 --> 01:17:48.455
<i>There's a book of lies
I know they'll try to sell you</i>


01:17:49.697 --> 01:17:53.258
<i>And they'll try and they'll try
To convince you to buy</i>


01:17:53.435 --> 01:17:54.925
<i>You need them</i>


01:17:56.905 --> 01:18:00.341
<i>So the next time you're down
Look inside, not around</i>


01:18:00.508 --> 01:18:03.671
<i>I can dress myself</i>


01:18:03.845 --> 01:18:06.780
<i>There's no need for someone's help</i>


01:18:06.948 --> 01:18:08.575
<i>There's no one to blame</i>


01:18:08.750 --> 01:18:14.484
<i>There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:18:14.656 --> 01:18:17.955
<i>I can justify</i>


01:18:18.126 --> 01:18:21.095
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:18:21.262 --> 01:18:24.459
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:18:24.632 --> 01:18:27.032
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:18:27.202 --> 01:18:30.330
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:18:31.806 --> 01:18:38.678
<i>Do you ever wonder
How anything can make you cry?</i>


01:18:38.847 --> 01:18:42.510
<i>Have yourself discover</i>


01:18:42.684 --> 01:18:49.681
<i>That the pain you feel
Is the pain that you deny</i>


01:18:49.858 --> 01:18:53.123
<i>You can bless yourself</i>


01:18:53.294 --> 01:18:56.195
<i>There's no need for someone else</i>


01:18:56.364 --> 01:19:03.793
<i>There's no one to blame
There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:19:03.972 --> 01:19:07.169
<i>I can justify</i>


01:19:07.342 --> 01:19:10.311
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:19:10.478 --> 01:19:13.572
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:19:13.748 --> 01:19:16.239
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:19:16.417 --> 01:19:19.147
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:19:36.671 --> 01:19:38.332
Thank you, ladies and gentlemen.


01:19:38.506 --> 01:19:41.907
We hope you enjoyed the Wellesley
Academy of Arts Showcase.


01:19:42.076 --> 01:19:44.636
Oh, my God, you were so good.


01:19:45.013 --> 01:19:47.345
Who are you?
You're like a freaking rock star.


01:19:47.515 --> 01:19:49.608
Are you kidding me? Man, she likes you...


01:20:00.828 --> 01:20:03.763
So, what did he say? Is he mad?


01:20:03.932 --> 01:20:05.593
Yeah. He's pretty ticked off...


01:20:05.767 --> 01:20:09.533
...that I'm not already making
the next big album for Kensington Records.


01:20:11.506 --> 01:20:13.269
Oh. Which album?


01:20:14.175 --> 01:20:15.199
Your album.


01:20:16.878 --> 01:20:18.869
- Are you kidding me?
- No.


01:20:20.481 --> 01:20:22.949
- You're... You're serious?
- Uh-huh.


01:20:25.186 --> 01:20:26.517
Go for it.


01:20:26.688 --> 01:20:29.452
We're making an album.
And we're writing it together.


01:20:29.624 --> 01:20:31.683
Yeah! Yeah!
I'm so happy.


01:20:31.859 --> 01:20:33.656
You know, I sing too.


01:20:33.828 --> 01:20:37.457
I can do a whole monologue album.
Incredible. Hey, congratulations.


01:20:37.632 --> 01:20:42.160
- Yo, blow it up. Boom.
I'm your boy. Call me up.


01:20:42.337 --> 01:20:45.738
Yeah. Yeah, he's really good
at guitars. He's a kook.


