How dare you? Teaching is my life.


01:21:17.939 --> 01:21:19.873
Give it up, Mom.


01:21:22.076 --> 01:21:23.543
Guy!


01:21:24.879 --> 01:21:28.542
I will have my nirvana moment.


01:21:28.783 --> 01:21:32.549
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:21:34.022 --> 01:21:37.082
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:21:37.258 --> 01:21:39.852
Oh, come on. Look alive, people.
I'm a star.


01:21:40.028 --> 01:21:41.586
Let's try this again.


01:21:41.796 --> 01:21:43.661
<i>I'll make you believe...</i>


01:21:45.233 --> 01:21:47.963
Oh, no. You want a piece of me?


01:22:13.628 --> 01:22:15.858
Hey. Clear.


01:22:31.546 --> 01:22:33.707
<i>Run this town tonight</i>


01:22:33.881 --> 01:22:36.247
Where's breakfast...? Sorry.


01:23:18.126 --> 01:23:20.720
<i>I'm lost in a world
That rattles my brain</i>


01:23:20.895 --> 01:23:23.762
<i>I'm cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:23:28.736 --> 01:23:32.263
- Katie, are you wearing a doormat?
- Welcome.


01:23:38.713 --> 01:23:40.772
Thanks. Now the pants.


01:23:45.953 --> 01:23:50.253
And then it would just take you somewhere
that you never expected you would go.


01:23:54.695 --> 01:23:57.687
<i>You wanna hear
the monologue from My Fair Lady?</i>


01:23:57.865 --> 01:23:59.992
Oy, mate, oy.


01:24:19.487 --> 01:24:21.352
I love my life.


01:24:21.522 --> 01:24:23.717
<i>Call me.
- Hello?</i>


01:24:46.180 --> 01:24:49.377
<i>Yeah. You like it? You like it? Yeah.</i>

